  "id": "abortion-laws",
  "term": "abortion laws",
  "definition": "Abortion laws are the legal rules that determine when and under what conditions a pregnancy may be terminated. In the source material, they are described as changing over time from restrictive, indication-based rules to more liberal access, including abortion on request within set gestational limits and reporting requirements for hospitals.",
